      "created_at": "2016-06-09T18:13:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This card seems to be working a little off.</p><p>I've played it twice, once with 4 players, once with 5.&nbsp;</p><p>With 5 players, Guise only gained 1 hp.&nbsp; With 4, he only gained 2 hp.&nbsp; Both times he had under 20 hp.</p><p>As you discard the top card of every deck, the minimum HP gain (unless you're near max hp) should be 3.&nbsp; With no incapped characters, the HP Gains should be 2+(H).&nbsp; Unless i'm missing something.</p><p>Is anyone else having this issue?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:37.923Z",
