      "created_at": "2016-06-09T18:26:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I had a guy, new to the game, play Guise because he loved Deadpool and played that card. Apparently \"Target\" means something different in the card games he was used to, so he was disappointed when he played it and got 0 HP back.</p><p>From what I can tell, best use of it is against The Matriarch, in the Final Wasteland, with a team of Unity and Captain Cosmic (and maybe Visionary).</p><p>Or in Realm of Discord while Imbued Vitality is out.</p>",
